# HOMEPAGE DESIGN SYSTEM ADHERENCE SPRINT
## Goal: Ensure 100% design system compliance, zero hardcoded values, complete token coverage

**Audit Date**: 2026-03-27
**Scope**: Homepage components design system adherence testing
**Strategy**: Token audit → Exception documentation → Automated adherence tests

================================================================================
PHASE 0 — OBSERVE (Current State & Research Synthesis)
================================================================================

## 0.1 Design System Configuration Audit

### Color Tokens (tailwind.config.ts)
**Brand Scale**: brand[50, 100, 200, 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, 800, 900]
- 50: #FEFCFB (lightest) → 900: #070808 (darkest)

**Secondary Scale**: secondary[50-900]
- 50: #FCFCFC → 900: #1A1A19

**Accent Scale**: accent[100-800] (gold)
- 100: #FBF6E8 → 800: #6B561C

**Semantic Surface Tokens**:
- surface.page: brand[700]
- surface.card: secondary[900]
- surface.elevated: secondary[800]
- surface.subtle: brand[800]
- surface.highlight: brand[200]
- surface.productImage: brand[200]

**Semantic Text Tokens**:
- text.primary: brand[400]
- text.secondary: secondary[400]
- text.caption: secondary[500]
- text.heroHeadline: brand[400]
- text.heroSubHeadline: secondary[300]
- text.headline: brand[400]
- text.subtitle: secondary[300]
- text.body: brand[200]
- text.accent: accent[500]
- text.overline: accent[500]
- text.priceTag: secondary[300]
- text.inverse: secondary[700]

**Border Tokens**:
- border.primary: secondary[300]
- border.secondary: secondary[700]

### Typography System (tailwind.config.ts)
**Type Utility Classes**:
- `.type-hero-headline`: Display hero text
- `.type-hero-sub`: Hero subheadline
- `.type-section-caption`: Section captions
- `.type-section-hed`: Section headings
- `.type-section-sub`: Section subtitles
- `.type-card-title`: Card titles
- `.type-metadata`: Metadata text
- `.type-price`: Price display
- `.type-overline`: Overline text (uppercase)
- `.type-body`: Body text
- `.type-caption`: Caption text

**Font Size Scale**:
- display-1: clamp(3rem, 4vw + 2rem, 5.625rem)
- display-2: clamp(2.25rem, 3vw + 1.5rem, 4.25rem)
- h1: clamp(1.6875rem, 2.25vw + 1.16rem, 3.1875rem)
- h2: clamp(1.25rem, 1.69vw + 0.854rem, 2.375rem)
- h3: clamp(1.125rem, 1.03vw + 0.883rem, 1.8125rem)
- h4: clamp(1rem, 0.56vw + 0.868rem, 1.375rem)
- body: 16px/24px
- action: 14px/21px
- small: 12px/16px
- cta-hero: clamp(1.125rem, 1vw + 0.9rem, 1.75rem)
- spotlight: 28px/32px

### Component Classes (tailwind.config.ts plugins)
**Button Components**:
- `.btn-primary`: Primary CTA button
- `.btn-cart`: Add to cart button
- `.btn-secondary`: Secondary button
- `.btn-ghost`: Ghost/text button

**Card Components**:
- `.card-base`: Base card styles
- `.card-product`: Product card with hover effects

**Input Components**:
- `.input-base`: Base input
- `.input-field`: Text field
- `.input-select`: Select dropdown

### Border Radius (tailwind.config.ts)
- lg: 4px
- md: 3px
- sm: 2px

### Box Shadows
- shadow-card: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)
- shadow-cardHover: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)
- shadow-button: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)
- shadow-buttonHover: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25)

### Spacing Custom Values
- desktop-header-h: var(--desktop-header-h)
- mobile-menu-h: var(--mobile-menu-h)
- feature-media: 450px

### Custom Screens
- xs: 475px
- 3xl: 1920px
- lg-touch: (min-width: 1024px) and (max-height: 850px)
- lg-desktop: (min-width: 1024px) and (min-height: 851px)
- pointer-fine: (pointer: fine)
- pointer-coarse: (pointer: coarse)

