### Components Analyzed (14 files):
```
app/components/features/homepage/
├── hero/Hero.tsx                    ✅ Uses type-*, btn-*, semantic colors
├── featured/Featured.tsx              ⚠️ 1 inline style exception (borderRadius: '3px')
├── featured/card/
│   ├── Card.tsx                     ✅ Uses card-product, type-*
│   ├── CardDetails.tsx              ✅ Uses type-* classes
│   └── CardMedia.tsx                ✅ Uses aspect ratios
├── product-spotlight-1/
│   └── ProductSpotlight1.tsx        ✅ Uses semantic tokens
├── product-spotlight-2/
