SCOPE CONTRACT 3.7 — Design System Visual Regression Tests
================================================================================
Files: tests/e2e/design-system/visual-regression.spec.ts

**Deliverable State**:
- Screenshots of all design system components
- Baseline images for comparison
- CI-integrated visual diff detection

**DoD Sequence**:
1. [ ] Create component screenshot suite
   - Screenshot each homepage section
   - Screenshot at 3 breakpoints (mobile, tablet, desktop)
   - Verification: Baseline images captured
   
2. [ ] Create visual diff test
   - Compare current screenshots to baselines
   - Threshold: 0.1% pixel diff
   - Verification: Visual changes detected
   
3. [ ] Create CI integration
   - Run on PRs
   - Update baselines on main branch merges
   - Verification: Visual regression in CI

**Verification Method**:
```bash
npm run test:design-system:visual
# Expected output:
# ✓ Hero section matches baseline
# ✓ Featured section matches baseline
# ⚠ ProductSpotlight1: 0.3% pixel diff (investigate)
```

**Minimal Testing**:
- Captures visual state
- Detects unintended visual changes
- CI-integrated for PR validation

