================================================================================
REGRESSION TEST SUITE SPECIFICATION
================================================================================

PURPOSE: Prevent design system drift and enforce token usage

TRIGGER: Every PR, every change to homepage components

DURATION TARGET: <10 seconds total

SUITE COMPOSITION:

**Critical Path (Always Run)** — 5s
1. Token existence (all tokens defined)
2. Hardcoded values (0 unhandled)

**Extended (Run on component changes)** — 10s
1. Semantic token adoption
2. Typography compliance
3. Component class compliance
4. Border radius compliance

**Commands**:
```bash
# Full design system test suite
npm run test:design-system

# Individual test suites
npm run test:design-system:tokens
npm run test:design-system:hardcoded
npm run test:design-system:semantic
npm run test:design-system:typography
npm run test:design-system:components
npm run test:design-system:border-radius
npm run test:design-system:visual
```

**Package.json Scripts**:
```json
{
  "test:design-system": "vitest run tests/design-system/",
  "test:design-system:tokens": "vitest run tests/design-system/token-existence.test.ts",
  "test:design-system:hardcoded": "vitest run tests/design-system/hardcoded-values.test.ts",
  "test:design-system:semantic": "vitest run tests/design-system/semantic-tokens.test.ts",
  "test:design-system:typography": "vitest run tests/design-system/typography-compliance.test.ts",
  "test:design-system:components": "vitest run tests/design-system/component-classes.test.ts",
  "test:design-system:border-radius": "vitest run tests/design-system/border-radius.test.ts",
  "test:design-system:visual": "npx playwright test tests/e2e/design-system/visual-regression.spec.ts"
}
```

